> Outlaw Blue, Apollo Orange, Hazard Yellow, Acid Green... Wanna guess what color is my next pick?
> — Lynae
 She is a Preparatory Program student at [[Startorch Academy]] and a free spirit who lives every day to its fullest. Before attending Startorch, she was a mercenary from the [[Lawless Zone]] in the [[New Federation]]. In order to escape from the Lawless Zone and gain her freedom, she stole the identity of the real [[Lynae (Fractsidus)|Lynae]] — a [[Fractsidus]] operative, who was attending Startorch Academy as a spy.

==Trivia==
She has a mini [[Clang Bang]] ornament on her clothes.